<view class="page paper-grain"><view class="storybook-title title">最近删除</view><text class="hint">旅行会保留30天，过期后才会彻底清理。</text><view wx:if="{{!items.length && !loading}}" class="empty">这里还没有被收进抽屉的旅行。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="item"><view><text class="storybook-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="date">删除于 {{item.deletedAt}}</text></view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restore">恢复</button></view></view>
